      "side": 0,
      "message": "The original macro uses GCC\u0027s statement expression extension ({ ... }), which is not supported by standard C++ compilers, causing compilation errors.\n\nAnd we can resolve the casting (u_int *) to (size_t *) with a temporary variable like below:\n\nsize_t tmp_len;\ncb_arg-\u003eutf8string_val \u003d gsh_strldup(attrs-\u003exattrs-\u003eval.val,\n                                     attrs-\u003exattrs-\u003eval.len,\n                                     \u0026tmp_len);\ncb_arg-\u003eutf8string_len \u003d (u_int)tmp_len; \n\n\nIs this change ok?",
      "parentUuid": "61b7b9e8_6fd13875",
      "revId": "6ac461ea252398b77e156ccd3227eb6749a9ad5c",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
